    "sub_name": "工業大數據分析與應用",
    "sub_ename": "INDUSTRIAL BIG DATA ANALYTICS AND APPLICATIONS",
    "describe_ch": "了解Prognostics and Health Management (PHM)的方法論。學習到完整的工業大數據分析技術，包括從資料擷、資料前處理、特徵提取、特徵篩選、資料建模、預測與資料可視化的方法。在本課程當中還使用數個從業界取得的真實資料來進行演示。",
    "describe_eh": "The main objective of this course is to understand the methodology of prognostics and health management (PHM). The students will learn the complete industrial big data analytics including data acquisition, data pre-preprocessing, feature extraction, feature selection, data modeling, prediction and data visualization. Several real application data from industries will be used for demonstration in this course.",
    "pre_subname": "AERO1004計算機程式語言",
    "pre_sub_id3": "AERO1004",
    "pre_sub_ename": "AERO1004 COMPUTER PROGRAMMING LANGUAGE",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "使學生瞭解大數據基本概念，以及處理大數據之能力。",
      "describe_en": " To acquire the understanding of basic concept of big data, and the methodalogy of processing big data"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "培養學生瞭解機器學習基本概念，以及模型訓練之能力。",
      "describe_en": " To gain the understanding of basic concept of machine learning, and the ability of training model"
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "培養學生應用擷取資料、資料前處理、特徵提取、特徵篩選、模型訓練、模型驗證、正確率計算於機器故障與剩餘可用壽命分析。",
      "describe_en": "To develop the ability of data acquisition, data preprocessing, feature extraction, feature selection, model training, model verification, and accuracy calculation and application to the analysis of fault diagnostics and remaining useful life prognostics for machinery."
    }
  ],
